                    %mi H
                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E\Box^H V
            is interpreted as a space of sections of the associated
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+bundle"} fiber bundle
            with structure group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
